<title>UK: Lasmo rises as oil price extends gains.</title>
<headline>Lasmo rises as oil price extends gains.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in oil and exploration group Lasmo Plc climbed on Monday as the oil price continued its bull run, dealers said.</p>
<p>Lasmo's shares rose 5p to 245p by 0922 GMT as Brent dated crude gained 15 cents to $19.92, a two-month high, from its Friday close of $19.77.  </p>
<p>The oil sector remained firm against the downward trend of the broader market with shares in Enterprise Oil Plc up 2-1/2p to 685-1/2p and British Petroleum Plc 2p higher at 726p.</p>
<p>--Andrew Langlands, London newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
